   {
    "title": "IBM Blockchain Food Trust",
    "description": "- Led a development team for a backend NodeJS micro service on IBM Cloud\n- Designed and implemented an end to end testing framework using Java Spring\n- Designed and implemented CI/CD pipeline on IBM Kubernetes and Istio\n\n- Computer Languages: Typescript, Javascript, NodeJS, GraphQL, Java\n- Tools: Visual Studio Code, Git, NPM, Travis/Jenkins CI/CD, Kubernetes, Istio\n- OS: Linux\n- DBMS: Janus Graph Database, Redis, Elastic Search\n- Methodologies: Agile, TDD\n- References: https://food.ibm.com, https://transparentsupply.ibm.com",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jun 2017 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "Micro Location System",
    "description": "- Devised a mathematical solution to determine an unknown position based on angles between at least 3 known points\n- Designed and implemented a micro-location device using IR line laser and RF receiver on Arduino to obtain angles between known points\n- Designed and implemented a beacon device using IR receiver and RF transmitter on Arduino to be set as the known points\n- Designed and implemented REST API server to calculate the position using the angles obtained by the micro-location device\n- Designed and implemented Google Maps based app to display the current location of the micro-location device with mm accuracy\n\n- Computer Languages: C++, Java Spring, Javascript (Angular)\n- Tools: Arduino IDE, Eclipse, Mongo CLI\n- OS: Linux\n- DBMS: MongoDB, Memcached\n- Methodologies: Agile, TDD\n- References: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1dPXn9hEWeg2nxDp8RiKmYmSmc7-UZjpC/view?usp=sharing",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "May 2015 - Apr 2022"
